<section class="update" aria-labelledby="update-h">
<h2 id="update-h">Software update</h2>
<p>An update was found on the USB stick: <code dir="ltr">@@BUNDLE@@</code></p>
<p>Its signature has been checked. Installing it restarts the box, which will be unavailable for a few minutes.</p>
<p class="note">Only install an update you were expecting. The box refuses any update that is not signed by its publisher.</p>
<form method="post" action="/status">
<input type="hidden" name="lang" value="en">
<input type="hidden" name="bundle" value="@@BUNDLE@@">
<button type="submit" name="action" value="install">Install</button>
</form>
</section>
